## Title: |cff4fc3f7Sheng|r Profession
## Title-zhTW: |cff4fc3f7阿聖|r專業幫手
## Notes: Profession helper for WoW Forever: leveling routes, profit table and crafting queue. Picks the cheapest route from Auctionator prices, lists the steps and a shopping list, and can create an Auctionator shopping list. /sprof to open.
## Notes-zhTW: 魔獸世界：永恆專業幫手：衝級路線、利潤表、製作佇列。依 Auctionator 價格挑最省的路線，列出製作步驟與購物清單，可一鍵建立 Auctionator 購物清單。/sprof 開啟。
